HolyHand re-implements every macOS-specific layer (Accessibility API,
Apple Vision, Keychain, AppKit menu bar, hotkey handling) using Windows
equivalents (UI Automation, Windows.Media.Ocr, Credential Manager, WPF,
low-level keyboard hooks). The agent loop design, candidate/prompt structure,
and verification logic are carried over from the upstream project.
